teams.issuesAddressed:
Big data analytics, including multi-source/scale/frequency/resolution data fusion and GIS spatial-temporal data analysis for infrastructure health and safety condition monitoring, assessment, and diagnosis;

 Study of fundamental characteristics of different sensing data, including smart phone accelerometer data, 3D laser scanning , 3D printing, mobile LiDAR, GPS/Inertia Measurement Unit (IMU), etc.;

 Innovative integration of sensor hardware, algorithms, and procedures to develop innovative solutions (e.g. mobile applications/tools);

 Real-world and real-time infrastructure behavior study of its health & safety condition and deterioration behavior in support of smart and resilient cities development.
